'''Crazed Yuki''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.1 Update|Version 5.1]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]] gains [[Immune to Slow|Immunity to Slow]] and has increased health, damage and movement speed. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

